@startuml organization-relationships
title Organization Canonical Relationships ; per CR-ES-022 section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as Org

class "Organizational Intent" as OI
class "Actor" as A
class "Role" as R
class "Responsibility" as Resp
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Resource" as Res
class "Activity" as Act
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraint" as Con
class "Governance" as Gov
class "Accountability" as Acct
class "Organizational Outcome" as OO
class "Escalation Boundary" as EB

Org --> OI : pursues
Org --> A : coordinates
Org --> R : allocates
Org --> Resp : allocates
Org --> Auth : delegates
Org --> Res : marshals
Org --> Act : undertakes
Org --> Auth : operates-within
Org --> Pol : governed-by
Org --> Con : constrained-by
Org --> Gov : operates-under
Org --> Acct : accountable-under
Org --> OO : produces
Org --> EB : escalates-through

note bottom of Org
  No foundational concept silently introduced per CR-ES-022 section 7.
  Deferred concepts per ADR-ES-022 section 12.
end note

@enduml
